Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Category cards: as tall as the question's stage, finds
 under their cards, votes on the foot

- The cards are scaled whole (zoom) to stand as tall as the question's
  stage they give way to: 1.36 x from 1100 x 900, 1.2 from 821 tall, 1.1
  on tall tablets; Delve together a step smaller where its votes need room.
- What a find gives sits under its own card (its column) on wide screens.
- Delve together: the voters' seals hang on the card's foot, side by side.
- The drawn card lifts a little less (clear of the line above, inside a
  phone's margins).

